<title>PERU: Peru bus crash kills 12.</title>
<headline>Peru bus crash kills 12.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bus slammed into a van towing a trailer on the outskirts of Lima, killing 12 people and injuring at least 30, police said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Witnesses said the packed bus ran into the back of the van at high speed shortly before midnight Monday, flinging passengers into the road. The bus driver was among those killed.</p>
